# Git Conventions

- Branch naming: feat/ADR-001-lifecycle, fix/POC-status-alias, docs/api-contract
- Commit messages: `feat(lifecycle): add toCanonical for match entity` (Conventional Commits)
- PR template: Link to ADR, list test cases, include screenshot for UI changes

# KSA Compliance Notes

- All user data must be processed per PDPL (Personal Data Protection Law)
- VAT calculation (15%) must be explicit in all financial fields
- Arabic RTL support required in all UI components
- Date formats: Hijri support preferred, Gregorian required
